WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.765
Dog went into the barn.

2
00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:13.745
"Who lives here?" he asked.

3
00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:16.816
"I live here," said Cow.

4
00:00:16.817 --> 00:00:20.836
"Bat and Pig and Cat do too."

5
00:00:20.837 --> 00:00:24.083
"Where is Cat?" asked Dog.

6
00:00:24.084 --> 00:00:27.689
"I don't know," said Cow.

7
00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.640
Cat was way up high.

8
00:00:30.641 --> 00:00:34.930
She held on tight.

9
00:00:34.931 --> 00:00:39.768
"Help!" she cried.

10
00:00:39.769 --> 00:00:42.282
"Cat!" called Pig.

11
00:00:42.283 --> 00:00:46.324
"Where are you?" said Cow.

12
00:00:46.325 --> 00:00:51.331
"I'm stuck in the tree!" cried Cat.

13
00:00:51.332 --> 00:00:57.074
"I can't get down!"

14
00:00:57.075 --> 00:01:00.885
"I can help!" said Dog.

15
00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:04.550
He ran to the house.

16
00:01:04.551 --> 00:01:07.989
"Woof! Woof!" said Dog.

17
00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:12.620
He barked and barked.

18
00:01:12.621 --> 00:01:24.153
At last Farmer came out.

19
00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:27.156
Dog ran back to the tree.

20
00:01:27.157 --> 00:01:31.778
Farmer ran too.

21
00:01:31.779 --> 00:01:37.634
Farmer knew what to do.

22
00:01:37.635 --> 00:01:42.604
He got Cat down.

23
00:01:42.605 --> 00:01:49.347
Everyone cheered.

24
00:01:49.348 --> 00:01:55.163
"Some dogs do like cats," said Cat.

